    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd86 Duck Farm!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Quack &amp; Hatch</i>, where you\u2019ll manage a duck farm. Begin with common ducks, gather food to level them up, and breed them to unlock new rare ducks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597900/extras/abfd1e78373fde1d28ba010b44ccb358.poster.avif?t=1743693413\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597900/extras/abfd1e78373fde1d28ba010b44ccb358.webm?t=1743693413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597900/extras/abfd1e78373fde1d28ba010b44ccb358.mp4?t=1743693413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80Level them up !!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up ducks makes them better famers and give you a better chance of hatching rare duck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597900/extras/a2375eeaa5ca36608693a74cd03b6197.poster.avif?t=1743693413\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597900/extras/a2375eeaa5ca36608693a74cd03b6197.apng?t=1743693413\" class=\"bb_img\" width=242 height=322 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd86 Duck Farm!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Quack &amp; Hatch</i>, where you\u2019ll manage a duck farm. Begin with common ducks, gather food to level them up, and breed them to unlock new rare ducks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597900/extras/abfd1e78373fde1d28ba010b44ccb358.poster.avif?t=1743693413\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597900/extras/abfd1e78373fde1d28ba010b44ccb358.webm?t=1743693413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597900/extras/abfd1e78373fde1d28ba010b44ccb358.mp4?t=1743693413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80Level them up !!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up ducks makes them better famers and give you a better chance of hatching rare duck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597900/extras/a2375eeaa5ca36608693a74cd03b6197.poster.avif?t=1743693413\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597900/extras/a2375eeaa5ca36608693a74cd03b6197.apng?t=1743693413\" class=\"bb_img\" width=242 height=322 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
